          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          7,
          8
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "To help tailor this information, are you asking for yourself or someone else, and does the person have any other health conditions (such as diabetes, kidney disease, or heart failure)?"
      }
